WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.263
Step five approves the hashes.

2
00:00:02.263 --> 00:00:05.473
The approver re-hashes the
three files after reading them,

3
00:00:05.473 --> 00:00:09.550
and this lab keeps each hash in a
variable, as a change record would keep it.

4
00:00:09.550 --> 00:00:13.000
Step six dry-runs the create
phase with the approved hash.

5
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.574
Without the apply switch
it connects to nothing:

6
00:00:15.574 --> 00:00:19.050
it checks the hash and prints the
sixteen statements it would run.

7
00:00:19.050 --> 00:00:22.423
Create login from external
provider for each Entra login,

8
00:00:22.423 --> 00:00:27.062
the Entra admin group added to sys-admin,
then the database users and their roles.

9
00:00:27.062 --> 00:00:31.549
Step seven tries a hash that isn't
the approved one, sixty-four zeros.

10
00:00:31.549 --> 00:00:35.830
The deploy stops before anything
connects: re-plan and re-approve.
